      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On the basis of above facts, a prayer has been made to dismiss the application."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3dfc08ec05514ea283d283108b86208e_92",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "26. The applicant, in this case, is in judicial custody, in connection with the offence punishable,\nunder Section 18(a)(i) read with Sections 17B, 36AC and 27."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "764b056548304401862492f153b63d85_93",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The provisions of Sections 17B, 18(a)(i)\nand 27 are reproduced, as under:-\n\"17B. Spurious drugs.--For the purposes of this Chapter, a drug shall be deemed to be spurious,--\n(a) if it is manufactured under a name which belongs to another dru"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fbfd7d91b0964d2f8e9d89e203e90f50_94",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(i) any drug which is not of a standard quality, or is misbranded, adulterated or spurious;\n27. Penalty for manufacture, sale, etc., of drugs in contravention of this Chapter.--Whoever, himself or by any other person on his behalf, manufac"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e6bfb00f375441b5865ac22844eff3bf_95",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": ", the expression \"relative\"\nmeans--"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a203306291874e33b3b97b02e4d2d0c6_97",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "27. As per the stand, taken by the Drugs Inspector, in this case, despite expiry of licence, on 27.01.2023, the firm M/s Glenmars Healthcare was dealing with the allopathic drugs and as per the report of the laboratory, the recovered drugs "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0af381e86f0f4fb68c7bd2f7f03bf803_98",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This fact is sufficient to point out the seriousness of the offence."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eaaa9c67969748be8b79dacaf89898a3_99",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "28. Merely, the complaint has been filed, after the investigation and the matter is now pending, before the Court of learned Special Judge, Nalagarh, H.P., does not mean that the seriousness of the offence, which is required to be taken int"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "14d5030b36494e5fbaf145a73dd7fd17_100",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "29. Huge quantity of drugs, i.e. Amoxus-500 capsules (69 boxes), Doxtil-200 tablets (79 boxes), MEF- 200 tablets (100 boxes), Zathron-500 tablets (26 boxes), Roxim-500 capsules (66 boxes) and Ampicillin-500 capsules (19 boxes), were found f"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7d7ddee6d5eb4470998fdd5f104170f6_101",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThe recovery of huge quantity of substandard/spurious 2024:HHC:15546 drugs speaks voluminously about the seriousness of the offence and in case, the applicant is ordered to be released on bail, it will give wrong signal to the society that"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "db440f8346e24354914c1c15ec86276f_102",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "30. Even otherwise, the release of the applicant, on bail, will also encourage other drug manufacturers to indulge in preparation/marketing of substandard/ spurious drugs to earn easy money."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "022c808ebc10469f9b1bf7c3af6c3f61_103",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "31. Moreover, the affect of the spurious drugs on the persons, who used to consume the same, in the hope and faith, is also one of the major factor, which cannot be ignored by this Court, at this stage."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b0eadb722cfe4e62a5ad05f1527ae466_104",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "32. So far as the much relied arguments of learned counsel, appearing for the applicant, that case of the applicant falls in the exception/window, as provided by the Legislature, in its wisdom, in Section 36AC of the Act, are concerned, alt"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8faca7efee6340bc86e3d6609750b546_105",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The report of the Government Analyst, Regional Drugs Testing Laboratory, Chandigarh, which has been reproduced above, also speaks voluminously about the seriousness of the offence, as,\npercentage of the actual contents, as per the analysis "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8c3ed1198a6f40fbaf2e9dde49dfbabb_106",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Another fact, which has rightly been highlighted, by learned Additional Advocate General, is that the similar case, regarding the indulgence of the applicant, in manufacturing of spurious drugs, has also been filed, against him, in the year"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "951690a849594f098b2926c6c1933988_107",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nReserved On : 10.12.2024 vs State Of Himachal Pradesh on 23 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/15330344/\n9 35."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dc397943a5584a3ba47d1e6f0fb4f674_108",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "At this stage, there is nothing on record to justify that the twin conditions, as numerated, in Section 36AC of the Act, are existing in favour of the applicant, as, it cannot be said that the applicant has not committed the offence, nor it"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "adf9a789e20c4c2c82874ef91c204625_109",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the absence of the said satisfaction, the bail application cannot be accepted."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a4893ceed76f46f9ae28ac694cde3b9e_111",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Considering the seriousness of the offence, as alleged, against the applicant and in view of the discussions, made hereinabove, this Court is of the view that the applicant is not able to make out a case for relief of bail."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9c95894c69fa45dfa31160e089ed0e2a_112",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "37. Consequently, the present bail application is dismissed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ddbc2f4bdcf744d5b0b3fc782ef39962_113",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "38. Any of the observations, made hereinabove, shall not be taken as an expression of opinion, on the merits of the case, as, these observations, are confined, only to the disposal of the present bail application."
    }
